    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nBrocán, 10b Green Park is an exceptional newly built semi-detached residence (BER: A0) of remarkable quality and architectural distinction well set back from the road, enjoying a south-westerly aspect to the rear. Developed by the highly regarded Brinnin Homes in collaboration with Extend Architects, this superb four-bedroom plus study family home extends to approximately 261 sq.m. (2,809 sq.ft.) and combines timeless mid-century inspired design with contemporary luxury and outstanding craftsmanship.\n\nNestled discreetly amongst the mature trees and elegant homes of Green Park, Brocán is one of just four individually designed residences within this exclusive boutique development on Orwell Road. Harmoniously integrated into its leafy surroundings while making a striking architectural statement, the property is both visually impressive and exceptionally functional. Clean architectural lines, natural materials and beautifully proportioned interiors create a home that is sophisticated, welcoming and perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nEvery aspect of the home has been thoughtfully considered and meticulously executed, from the bespoke detailing and premium specification to the seamless flow of the light-filled accommodation. Designed to maximise both comfort and practicality, the generous living spaces are tailored to the demands of contemporary family life. Furthermore, the house has an A0 Building Energy Rating, which is a new category for the most energy-efficient buildings that do not use fossil fuels. A-rated homes are the most energy-efficient and comfortable and ensure exceptional energy efficiency and year-round comfort, delivering a future-proofed home today.\n\nGreen Park enjoys an enviable location in the heart of Rathgar, offering the perfect balance of tranquillity and connectivity. Surrounded by mature green areas, this highly sought-after address is just moments from the Windy Arbour Luas stop, providing swift access to Dublin city centre, Dundrum and beyond. \n\nRenowned for its outstanding selection of schools, enduring sense of community and exceptional amenities, Rathgar remains one of South Dublin's most desirable residential locations. Nearby Rathgar Village, Rathmines, Churchtown and Dundrum offer an abundance of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday conveniences, while an excellent choice of parks, sports clubs and recreational facilities supports an active and vibrant lifestyle.\n\nMore than simply a home, Brocán, 10b Green Park represents an exciting opportunity to acquire a residence of exceptional design, quality and character in one of Dublin's most established and sought-after neighbourhoods."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGround Floor - \n\n\nReception Hall - \nTiled floor, wainscot panelling, bespoke banister and balustrade, cloaks closet and boot room, plant room, glazed doors to living room and to kitchen / dining / family room.\n\nLiving Room - \nEngineered oak herringbone floor with brass inlay, large picture window overlooking front garden, wainscot panelling, coving with LED perimeter lighting, spotlights.\n\nShower Room/Guest WC - \nWith wc, wash hand basin, shower cubicle with rainwater shower head and hand shower attachment, backlit mirror, tiled floor and part tiled walls, recessed lights.\n\nKitchen / Dining / Family Room - \nL-shaped open plan room with wide plank engineered oak floor, floor to ceiling windows and sliding door to rear garden taking in the wonderful south-westerly aspect. Spotlights and LED lighting. Bespoke Michael Farrell Joinery kitchen with extensive range of wall and floor units with Jacobean oak doors and Roble Palma interiors, incorporating an appliance garage with Siemens microwave and sink, full height Siemens fridge and full height Siemens freezer. 2 Siemens studio line ovens, Siemens dishwasher, Blanco sink, Quooker Viva brass tap, bin store, porcelain countertop. A large island and breakfast bar with a 'Taj Mahal' countertop includes a Bora induction hob with integrated downdraft extractor fan, Cople wine fridge, and fantastic additional storage.\n\nUtility Room - \nWall and floor storage units with quartz countertop and Hafele sink with mixer tap. Plumbed for washing machine with space for tumble dryer, tiled floor, recessed lights.\n\nFirst Floor - \nLight-filled landing with accommodation off and stairwell to top floor.\n\nBedroom 2 (front) - \nLarge double room to front with full height door/window with safety screen, fitted wardrobes, spotlights & track lighting, door to:\n\nEnsuite Shower Room - \nWith wc, twin wash hand basins on drawer unit, large shower cubicle with rainwater shower head and hand shower attachment, mirror, heated towel rail, opaque window, part tiled walls tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 3 (rear) - \nLarge double room with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 4 (rear) - \nDouble room with built-in wardrobes.\n\nFamily Bathroom - \nWith wc, wash hand basin on drawer unit, mirror, shower cubicle with rainwater shower head and hand shower attachment, free-standing bath with external mixer tap, tiled floor and part tiled walls, recessed lights, heated towel rail.\n\nStudy/Home Office - \nIdeal home office to front with spotlights, window\n\nSecond Floor - \nLanding with Velux window.\n\nPlant room - \n\n\nPrincipal Bedroom (Bedroom 1) - \nWonderful principal suite comprising large double room with vaulted ceiling, dormer window overlooking the gardens of Green Park, through to:\n\nDressing / Storage area: - \nComplete with extensive fitted shelving, drawers and wardrobes with feature lighting, recessed lights. Door to:\n\nEnsuite Shower Room - \nComprising wc, wash hand basin on drawer unit, walk-in shower with rainwater shower head and hand shower attachment, heated towel rail, tiled floor and part tiled walls, vaulted ceiling with Velux window.\n\nOUTSIDE - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nWalled, fenced and gated front garden with large gravel driveway with ample off-street parking. Mature borders have been planted with a wide selection of shrubs, flowering plants and hedging. Electric car charge point. Gated side passage to rear garden.\n\nRear Garden - \nThe landscaped rear garden measures approximately 125m2 and enjoys an idyllic sunny south-westerly aspect. Walled and fenced, it features a large granite patio area, positioned off the kitchen/dining/family room, creating a veritable 'outdoor room' ideal for al fresco dining. The lawned area is bordered by well-stocked beds planted with a variety of shrubs and flowering plants providing year-round colour and interest. A bin-store is cleverly positioned off the patio area, near the side passage.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Brocán, 10b Green Park is a brand new 4-bed plus study semi-detached home</li><li>BER: A0</li><li>Offers 261 sqm / 2809 sqft approx. of well-appointed accommodation</li><li>Sunny south-westerly rear garden</li><li>Ample off-street parking to front with EV charge point </li><li>Exclusive boutique development of 4 brand-new, unique, architect-designed, eco homes comprising 2 x semi-detached homes and 2 x detached homes</li><li>Developed by renowned Brinnin Homes in collaboration with Extend Architects</li><li>Development sits serenely within the leafy neighbouring surrounds of the highly sought-after enclave of Green Park </li><li>Combines a perfect blend of refined mid-century style with cutting-edge sustainability and exceptional craftmanship</li><li>Thoughtfully designed to maximise light, space and comfort</li><li>Offers generously proportioned interiors perfectly suited to modern family living</li><li>At the heart of each bespoke home:</li><li> - Custom-made hardwood hall door</li><li> - Meticulously crafted, handmade kitchen by Michael Farrelly Joinery paired with premium high-end Siemens and Bora appliances</li><li> - Fitted wardrobes in all bedrooms</li><li> - Generous electrical layouts</li><li> - NIBE air-to-water heat pump system with whole house heat recovery ventilation</li><li> - Underfloor heating throughout the ground and first floors</li><li> - Engineered oak herringbone and oak plank flooring throughout the downstairs</li><li> - NorDan triple glazed windows and double glazed sliding doors </li><li> - CAT-6 cabling</li><li> - Wired for alarm and cctv </li><li> - Wired for solar panels</li><li> - Electric car charge point</li><li> - HomeBond 10-year warranty</li><li> - Hard and soft landscaping front and rear</li><li> - Ample parking </li><li> - Gated vehicular access with data and power for potential automation</li><li> - Gated pedestrian side access to rear garden </li><li> - Garden and outdoor lighting </li><li> - A 10-minute walk to Windy Arbour Luas stop </li><li> - Adjacent Milltown Golf Club</li><li> - Close to Rathgar village</ul>"
